  "bodyHash": "f3f96e273f42ff03",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V1HpUCC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1770\" height=\"870\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:24px\"><strong>由《Vic's Modern Warfare》原版作者打造，《Point Blank》是一款枪械模组，侧重于社区贡献，旨在打造一款在风格上与《我的世界》大致契合的枪械模组。</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#9cf;font-size:24px\"><strong><em>支持 Minecraft 版本 1.20.1、1.21.1 和 1.21.11！</em></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;font-size:24px\"><strong>来看看这些扩展包吧！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">毁灭战士扩展包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-doom-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XfaZVxe.png\" alt=\"描述文本\" width=\"242\" height=\"242\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">半条命扩展包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-half-life-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_c9d74444-db0e-4ade-8d54-4da32a28f134.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"217\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">GGO扩展包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-gun-gale-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_54242b54-6f70-4904-bfda-0ca4293dd260.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"215\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Point Blank 扩展版扩展包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-point-blank-extended-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_e637b9dd-e498-4151-a639-d2f2d08b73e4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"213\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">命运扩展包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-destiny-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q3iL0A3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"213\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">（官方）蔚蓝档案扩展包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-blue-archive-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BHrUfDi.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"212\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">赛博朋克2077扩展包（社区制作）：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/cyberpunk-2077-guns-for-vics-point-blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/996/840/64/64/638513964039333793.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">光环：冬季预案扩展包（社区制作）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/vpb-halo-winter-contingency\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1433/208/64/64/638928593681850821.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"138\" height=\"138\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在游戏内管理这些扩展包。或者通过菜单顶部的按钮浏览器查找更多扩展包：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5yl3RSY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"536\" height=\"302\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Point Blank 以契合《我的世界》美学的方式添加枪械，同时绝不妥协于高质量模型与动画。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>该模组的主要特色是让你能够零代码知识或经验，快速将自定义的高质量枪械添加到游戏中。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>这是一款对创作者极其友好的模组：如果你已经准备好了建模、贴图且带动画的枪械，最快只需 10 分钟即可将其加入游戏。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>上手简单，实现轻松。</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I5TEgBi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"622\" height=\"188\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1fjbZSU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"323\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cI6rcHk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"453\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K3wezC6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"453\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>默认情况下，Point Blank 自带约 40 种武器（且数量仍在增加）。其中许多枪械具备射击模式，按下“B”键即可切换。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>所有枪械均拥有高质量的上弹、检视和拔枪动画。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>枪械存在精度差异。奔跑时武器精度会降低，瞄准时精度会提高。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>生存模式：所有武器均可通过“武器打印机”在生存模式中制作！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m9udtQ7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J79QxYG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>自定义：武器支持安装配件进行自定义！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UW3Tvel.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"752\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZSKeLsT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1167\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>创作 Point Blank 内容需要两项重要工具：Geckolib 和 Blockbench。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Blockbench 是一款第三方软件，支持你对物体进行建模、贴图与动画制作。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你还需要在 Blockbench 中安装 Geckolib 插件。如需更多信息，请参阅 Geckolib 说明中提供的 Geckolib Wiki。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>入门请查看我们的<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-template-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方模板内容包</a></span>。你可以使用它来创作自己的内容。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong>视频教程：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ASlc1_bvItE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lDwSw3pE_1k\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JEa0fKyU2QI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
